#   pre-gate  (3969d36, no gate):   total ~11.5s  t2v ~8.8s  hs-wait n/a (probe cadence)
#   post-gate (3969d36 + gate):     total ~11.7s  t2v ~9.0s  hs-wait 5511-5513ms (rekey floor)
#   post-bump (a89bba82 + gate):    total ~6.4s   t2v ~3.7-4.2s  hs-wait 500-501ms
